      "summaries": {
        "en": "CodeGraph is a tool that creates a pre-indexed knowledge graph of your codebase, reducing token usage and tool calls for Claude Code. It builds a local graph of code symbols and their relationships, enabling efficient context retrieval. Use it to speed up code understanding and AI-assisted development by providing structured code insights without sending data to external servers.",
        "zh": "CodeGraph 是一个为代码库构建预索引知识图谱的工具，旨在减少 Claude Code 的 token 消耗和工具调用次数。它通过分析代码中的符号及其关系，生成一个完全本地的知识图，使得 AI 助手能够更高效地理解代码结构。使用时，只需将 CodeGraph 集成到开发流程中，即可在本地快速检索代码上下文，无需将代码发送到外部服务器。这一设计特别适合大型代码库的智能导航和 AI 辅助开发，帮助开发者更快地定位关键模块和依赖关系。",
        "es": "CodeGraph is a tool that creates a pre-indexed knowledge graph of your codebase, reducing token usage and tool calls for Claude Code. It builds a local graph of code symbols and their relationships, enabling efficient context retrieval. Use it to speed up code understanding and AI-assisted development by providing structured code insights without sending data to external servers.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "codegraph gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "CodeGraph is a tool that creates a pre-indexed knowledge graph of your codebase, reducing token usage and tool calls for Claude Code. It builds a local graph of code symbols and their relationships, enabling efficient context retrieval. Use it to speed up code understanding and AI-assisted development by providing structured code insights without sending data to external servers.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/colbymchenry/codegraph for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
