      "summaries": {
        "en": "DeepSeek-V4-Pro is an advanced open-source language model designed for high-quality text generation and conversational AI. It builds on the Mixture-of-Experts architecture, activating only relevant parameters per token for efficiency. With FP8 quantization support, it reduces memory usage without sacrificing performance. You can deploy it via Hugging Face's endpoints or run it locally with transformers. Ideal for chatbots, content creation, and code assistance, it offers a strong balance of capability and accessibility.",
        "zh": "DeepSeek-V4-Pro 是一个先进的开源语言模型，专为高质量文本生成和对话式 AI 设计。它基于混合专家架构，每次推理只激活部分参数，从而在保持性能的同时大幅提升效率。模型支持 FP8 量化，能显著降低显存占用，适合在消费级 GPU 上运行。你可以通过 Hugging Face 的推理端点直接使用，或利用 transformers 库本地部署。典型应用包括智能客服、内容创作和代码辅助。其 MIT 许可证允许自由商用和修改，是构建 AI 应用的实用选择。",
        "es": "DeepSeek-V4-Pro is an advanced open-source language model designed for high-quality text generation and conversational AI. It builds on the Mixture-of-Experts architecture, activating only relevant parameters per token for efficiency. With FP8 quantization support, it reduces memory usage without sacrificing performance. You can deploy it via Hugging Face's endpoints or run it locally with transformers. Ideal for chatbots, content creation, and code assistance, it offers a strong balance of capability and accessibility.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "DeepSeek-V4-Pro stands out for transformers, safetensors, and deepseek_v4 in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "DeepSeek-V4-Pro is an advanced open-source language model designed for high-quality text generation and conversational AI. It builds on the Mixture-of-Experts architecture, activating only relevant parameters per token for efficiency. With FP8 quantization support, it reduces memory usage without sacrificing performance. You can deploy it via Hugging Face's endpoints or run it locally with transformers. Ideal for chatbots, content creation, and code assistance, it offers a strong balance of capability and accessibility.",
          "how": "Review https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
